---
// Uber API Gateway 4-Generation Evolution Architecture Diagram Component
---

<figure class="uber-gw-diagram" aria-labelledby="uber-gw-caption">
  <svg
    class="uber-gw-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="uber-gw-title uber-gw-desc"
  >
    <title id="uber-gw-title">Uber 全球 API 閘道四代架構演進</title>
    <desc id="uber-gw-desc">
      展示 Uber 從單體 Node.js RTAPI (第 1 代)、去中心化自營閘道 (第 2 代)、邊緣
      gRPC 閘道 (第 3 代)，演進至現代宣告式、多區域主動路由與自動生成 BFF 的統一
      API 閘道 (第 4 代)。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="ugw-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="ugw-arrow-emerald"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"
          class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Gen 1: Monolith Edge -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 1 (2014)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52"
        >單體 Node.js RTAPI</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 單體 Node.js 處理程序</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• 負責所有客戶端請求路由</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• 業務邏輯與轉發嚴重偶合</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn"
        x="16"
        y="152">⚠️ CPU 阻塞與部署單點故障</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 2: Decentralized Gateways -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(260, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 2 (2016)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52">去中心化領域閘道</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 各業務線自建 Gateway</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• 鑑權、限流規則重複造輪</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• 通訊協定與監控指標分歧</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn"
        x="16"
        y="152">⚠️ 維運成本與安全性碎片化</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 3: Edge gRPC Gateway -->
    <g class="uber-gw-diagram__card" transform="translate(490, 40)">
      <rect width="200" height="170" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__badge" x="16" y="24">GEN 3 (2019)</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__title" x="16" y="52">邊緣 gRPC 閘道</text>
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="78"
        >• 引入 Envoy / Go 邊緣層</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="98"
        >• JSON 轉 gRPC/Thrift 轉發</text
      >
      <text class="uber-gw-diagram__desc" x="16" y="118"
        >• 統一身份驗證與基礎限流</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__tag uber-gw-diagram__tag--info"
        x="16"
        y="152">ℹ️ 跨區域流量排程仍受限</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Gen 4: Modern Unified Declarative Gateway (Large Bottom Block) -->
    <g
      class="uber-gw-diagram__card uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald"
      transform="translate(30, 240)"
    >
      <rect width="900" height="180" rx="12"></rect>
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__badge uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald"
        x="20"
        y="26">GEN 4 (CURRENT): UNIFIED DECLARATIVE API PLATFORM</text
      >
      <text
        class="uber-gw-diagram__title uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald"
        x="20"
        y="56">現代宣告式統一 API 閘道生態系</text
      >

      <!-- Sub Column 1: Schema-first -->
      <g transform="translate(20, 75)">
        <rect width="265" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >01. Schema-First 宣告定義</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• Protobuf / Thrift 統一合約</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 自動生成 BFF 與型別防護</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Sub Column 2: Traffic Engine -->
      <g transform="translate(315, 75)">
        <rect width="270" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >02. 多區域動態流量排程</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• Multi-Region Active-Active</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 跨區自動故障轉移 &amp; Sharding</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- Sub Column 3: Resilience & Security -->
      <g transform="translate(615, 75)">
        <rect width="265" height="85" rx="8" class="uber-gw-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subtitle" x="12" y="22"
          >03. 自適應韌性與安全</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• Token Bucket + 延遲感應限流</text
        >
        <text class="uber-gw-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 全鏈路 mTLS 與分散式追蹤</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Arrows across Generations -->
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 230 125 H 255"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 460 125 H 485"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald"
      d="M 590 210 V 235"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow-emerald)"></path>

    <!-- Arrow to Gen 4 from right side -->
    <path
      class="uber-gw-diagram__arrow uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald"
      d="M 690 125 H 780 Q 820 125 820 180 V 235"
      marker-end="url(#ugw-arrow-emerald)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile Version -->
  <div class="uber-gw-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card">
      <span class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge">第 1 代 (2014)</span>
      <h4>單體 Node.js RTAPI</h4>
      <p>
        單一 Node 程序負責全域路由與轉發，業務邏輯強偶合，存在嚴重單點故障與 CPU
        阻塞風險。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 拆分領域閘道</div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card">
      <span class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge">第 2 代 (2016)</span>
      <h4>去中心化領域自建閘道</h4>
      <p>
        各業務團隊自建 API
        Gateway，鑑權與限流重複造輪子，維運成本暴增且架構碎片化。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 引入邊緣代理標準</div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card">
      <span class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge">第 3 代 (2019)</span>
      <h4>邊緣 gRPC 閘道 (Envoy)</h4>
      <p>
        集中邊緣認證、JSON/gRPC 轉發與基本限流，但跨區域流量排程與 BFF
        生成仍未完全自動化。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow">↓ 現代宣告式架構升級</div>

    <div
      class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald"
    >
      <span
        class="uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald"
        >第 4 代 (現行)</span
      >
      <h4>現代宣告式統一 API 平台</h4>
      <p>
        Protobuf Schema-First 自動生成
        BFF、多區域主動雙活路由（Active-Active）、自適應延遲感知限流與全鏈路
        mTLS 安全防護。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="uber-gw-caption">
    圖 1：Uber API 閘道架構四代演進：從單體 RTAPI、去中心化閘道、邊緣 gRPC
    到現代宣告式多區域主動 API 平台。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .uber-gw-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card, #f8fafc);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram {
    background: #090e17;
    border-color: #1e293b;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .uber-gw-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--color-border, #cbd5e1);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #131b2e;
    stroke: #25334d;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #f0fdf4;
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__card--emerald rect {
    fill: #062e24;
    stroke: #059669;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff !important;
    stroke: #a7f3d0 !important;
    stroke-width: 1.2 !important;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #0d382f !important;
    stroke: #047857 !important;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: #64748b;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald {
    fill: #059669;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__badge--emerald {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald {
    font-size: 16px;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__title--emerald {
    fill: #6ee7b7;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subtitle {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #065f46;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__subtitle {
    fill: #a7f3d0;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__desc {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: #475569;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__desc {
    fill: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__subdesc {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    fill: #047857;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__subdesc {
    fill: #d1fae5;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn {
    fill: #d97706;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__tag--warn {
    fill: #fbbf24;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__tag--info {
    fill: #2563eb;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__tag--info {
    fill: #60a5fa;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: #94a3b8;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow {
    stroke: #475569;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #10b981;
    stroke-width: 2.2;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow--emerald {
    stroke: #34d399;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head {
    fill: #475569;
  }

  .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #10b981;
  }

  :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram__arrow-head--emerald {
    fill: #34d399;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive for mobile */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .uber-gw-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--color-bg-surface, #ffffff);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card {
      background: #131b2e;
      border-color: #25334d;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald {
      border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
      background: #f0fdf4;
    }

    :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card--emerald {
      background: #062e24;
      border-color: #059669;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #64748b;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #059669;
    }

    :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-badge--emerald {
      color: #34d399;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text-main, #0f172a);
    }

    :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card h4 {
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--color-text-muted, #475569);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    :global(.dark) .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-card p {
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    .uber-gw-diagram-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748b;
      padding: 0.125rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
